@Order.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5106

### Succeeds: total 200 is below the simulated balance (3000)
POST {{Order.API_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": "1",
  "orderItems": [ { "productId": 1, "count": 2, "price": 100 } ],
  "payment": { "cardName": "John Doe", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111", "expiration": "12/30", "cvv": "123", "totalPrice": 200 },
  "address": { "line": "Main St 1", "province": "Istanbul", "district": "Besiktas" }
}

### Fails at payment: total 5000 exceeds the balance, reserved stock is released
POST {{Order.API_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": "1",
  "orderItems": [ { "productId": 2, "count": 10, "price": 500 } ],
  "payment": { "cardName": "John Doe", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111", "expiration": "12/30", "cvv": "123", "totalPrice": 5000 },
  "address": { "line": "Main St 1", "province": "Istanbul", "district": "Besiktas" }
}

### Fails at stock: product 4 only has 10 units seeded
POST {{Order.API_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": "1",
  "orderItems": [ { "productId": 4, "count": 50, "price": 1 } ],
  "payment": { "cardName": "John Doe", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111", "expiration": "12/30", "cvv": "123", "totalPrice": 50 },
  "address": { "line": "Main St 1", "province": "Istanbul", "district": "Besiktas" }
}
